WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Recognition comes from repeated visual cues, but a single photo or badge does not prove an entire brand story. Compare evidence across examples.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
List three observable repeated features, then label which are measured and which are your interpretation.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Blind silhouette challenge

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A view can support interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance by itself.

